EngLawArticles.EngArticleContent:
In addition to the measures listed in the preceding Article, banks shall also take the following internal measures:
1. Notify the responsible department in the head office or group headquarters in accordance with applicable internal procedures;
2. Report the measures that have been and will be adopted to the responsible department of the head office or group headquarters in accordance with applicable internal procedures;
3. Make a note in the bank's internal information system to remind each branch to take precautions.
